> A hand-checkable calculation

Per-row scaling of2,4,6 gives approximately0,.5,1 with the source1e-6 denominator offset. Source value transforms are disabled by default; optional transform helpers do not silently change training targets.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/muzero_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
