> Inspect the native model architecture

Source representation, one latent transition with action0 and the two-action prediction head. This trace uses an independent store and does not change fitting.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/muzero_network.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
